        "created_at": "2017-02-22T01:51:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Melkhor\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Melkhor:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>LewdDolphin21 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;Melkhor wrote:<br><blockquote>Honestly, I've never even seen Heroic Infinitor flip, and unless you're playing to deliberately flip him as soon as possible (for some arcane reason), I doubt most teams could even hope to survive that situation.&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nI played one advanced match where he flipped on his first turn, due to some bad combination of manifestations exclusively hitting Infinitor.\n</blockquote></div>\nDid you survive the experience?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I did not survive :(. At some point I just reset because I couldn't overcome the damage.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
