        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-22T14:53:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint. No sweat.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I have played Heroic Infinitor 60-70 times on the video game, and I've had him flip on me 3 times. I actually turned two of those into victories. I don't remember <em>exactly</em> how, because it has been a while, but I know that one of them involved Nightmist being the only hero left and there was&nbsp;a certain helpful set of incap abilities.&nbsp; She may have even ended near full HP. I remember it being epic, with Nightmist nearly biting the dust (mist?) on multiple occasions.</p>\n<p>Also it took more than 2 hours.</p>\n<p>After he flipped.</p>\n<p>On the video game.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=9\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 22,
