        "created_at": "2017-02-24T19:46:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just a note that Heroic Infinitor's win condition might be another one of those nice endings where it comes up with the little slider that says \"Hey, you killed all the manifestations, You win. &nbsp;Slide to continue\" or whatever. &nbsp;Obviously if you've carefully read the card, you know what you're trying to do, but sometimes in the AE madness of targets flitting by, you can miss that the last manifestation finally went down.</p>",
